{"4994920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Goat Together", "steam_appid": 4994920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5126200], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the wildest climbing competition you'll ever experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goat Together</strong> is a chaotic physics-based party game for <strong>2-8 players</strong> where you take control of clumsy, goofy goats determined to reach the top. Every match is packed with unpredictable moments as you climb dangerous courses, dodge tricky obstacles, and try to keep your balance while the mountain fights back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the biggest obstacle isn't the course... it's your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4994920/extras/1e2675be501f4a55380b7940595ad0e3.poster.avif?t=1787070494\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4994920/extras/1e2675be501f4a55380b7940595ad0e3.webm?t=1787070494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4994920/extras/1e2675be501f4a55380b7940595ad0e3.mp4?t=1787070494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge into your opponents with powerful headbutts, knock them off the track, and steal the lead before they get their revenge. Every push, every fall, and every perfectly timed hit can completely change the outcome of the match. Score the most points across multiple rounds and prove you're the one true <strong>King of the Mountain</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're competing for first place or laughing after being launched off a cliff, no two matches ever play out the same. With chaotic physics, unpredictable gameplay, and plenty of opportunities 